    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d76">

                <pb facs="0177" n="97" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg97"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">King of the Belgians to the President.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bagnères de Luchon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-09-06"><hi rendition="#italic">September 6,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Am glad that you escaped from the serious accident by which you have been
                    menaced; beg you to accept my most sincere and cordial congratulations.</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#small-caps">King of the Belgians.</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
